        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, inner door, opaquely painted, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, inner door, opaquely painted, at plant
The measures of the visible door leaf are 0.9m x 2m. The door and corresponding frame are painted. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.;
UUID: 818fc822-9812-341b-b784-6777192b5716
Included are the materials used for the surface treatment (opaquely painted) of the inner door leaf and the door frame. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 door manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_818fc822-9812-341b-b784-6777192b5716.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
